{"input": "我不知道", "status": "completed", "intent": {"clarification_kind": "content", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["defer"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "", "relation": "continuation", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户表示不知道想学什么，尚无具体主题，属于暂时没有方向，先轻量回应并给出可选方向示例，不建立目标、不进入工作流。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": false, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "没关系，不知道从哪儿开始很常见。你可以先说说最近让你卡住或好奇的事——比如工作里遇到的某个概念、想补的基础知识，或者想了解的行业话题。也可以直接抛给我一个具体的疑问，我们从那个点展开。", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "resolved_input": null, "replies": ["没关系，不知道从哪儿开始很常见。你可以先说说最近让你卡住或好奇的事——比如工作里遇到的某个概念、想补的基础知识，或者想了解的行业话题。也可以直接抛给我一个具体的疑问，我们从那个点展开。"], "task_states": [], "nodes": ["received", "understanding", "intent", "model_attempt", "intent", "intent_decided", "response", "completed"], "search_state": null, "provider_events": [], "preparation": [], "sources": []}
{"input": "harness是什么，它有什么作用", "status": "completed", "intent": {"clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["question"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "", "relation": "new_topic", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户提出具体概念问题“harness 是什么，它有什么作用”，属于普通知识问答；对话中没有任何领域上下文，先按通用含义解释，并简要区分测试 harness、AI Agent harness 等常见含义。无需建立学习目标或追问用途。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "resolved_input": null, "replies": ["“harness”这个词本身有多个含义，先分清你问的是哪一个。\n\n- 日常英语：**线束、挽具、安全带**一类用来“套住并引导”某物的装置。\n- 软件测试：**test harness**，指自动运行测试并收集结果的那套框架代码。\n- AI 领域：**agent harness**（智能体运行时/脚手架），是目前讨论最多的用法。\n\n如果你指的是 AI 领域，它的定位是**模型之外的那一层运行时系统**。核心作用是：模型只负责“决定下一步做什么”，而 harness 负责让这个决定真正落到现实里——装配上下文、注册并调用工具、保存与恢复状态、检查权限、把执行结果回灌给模型，出错时决定重试、回滚还是交给人工。有个常被引用的概括是 `Agent = Model + Harness`：模型是无状态的，harness 才是让它能连续多步行动、跨轮次推进长任务的关键。\n\n一个直观例子：你让智能体“修好这个项目的失败测试”。模型输出的只是一句意图或一个工具调用结构，它并不会真的读文件、跑测试。真正去读 README、执行命令、把报错信息送回模型、在改错后重试，并保证进程重启还能接着做的，都是 harness。反过来，单轮问答或步骤完全固定的脚本，通常不需要它。\n\n需要留意：上面关于 agent harness 的定位来自面向学习者的整理资料，不是官方标准定义，不同团队的分层习惯会有差异；而普通词义和 test harness 的具体机制，这次没有覆盖到。\n\n如果方便，说一下你在哪个场景遇到这个词——读文档、写测评，还是在做智能体开发？这样能给你更贴合的说明。\n\n### 参考资料\n\n- [Agent harness](https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agent_harness)\n- [Agent Engineering 101｜01｜Agent Harness](https://llm101.ai/what-is-agent-harness/)\n- [Agent Harness（Agent 脚手架 / 运行时控制层）：核心概念、使用场景与实践说明 | Agent Wiki](https://learnagent.wiki/agent/cards/agent-harness)"], "task_states": [], "nodes": ["received", "understanding", "intent", "model_attempt", "intent", "intent_decided", "teaching_preparation", "model_attempt", "teaching_preparation", "search_attempt", "web_provider", "web_provider", "public_search", "source_candidates", "model_attempt", "source_candidates", "web_provider", "web_provider", "web_provider", "web_provider", "web_provider", "web_provider", "evidence_assessment", "model_attempt", "evidence_assessment", "search_verified", "answer", "model_attempt", "response.started", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "answer", "sources", "response.completed", "learning_evidence", "completed"], "search_state": "verified", "provider_events": [{"provider": "exa", "operation": "search", "status": "started", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "search", "status": "succeeded", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "started", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "succeeded", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "started", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "succeeded", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "started", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "succeeded", "code": ""}], "preparation": [{"official_sources_required": false, "source_domains": [], "concepts": ["harness 的通用含义（线束/安全带/挽具）", "测试 harness（test harness）", "Agent harness（智能体框架层）"], "public_query": "harness 含义 测试 harness test harness 作用 Agent harness 定义", "new_knowledge": true}], "sources": [{"url": "https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agent_harness", "chars": 2960}, {"url": "https://llm101.ai/what-is-agent-harness/", "chars": 10000}, {"url": "https://learnagent.wiki/agent/cards/agent-harness", "chars": 7731}]}
{"input": "给刚才的 Agent harness 举个生活类比就好", "status": "completed", "intent": {"clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["example"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "用生活类比解释 Agent harness", "relation": "continuation", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户要求对已有讲解（Agent harness）补一个生活类比，属于局部追问，不需要切换模式或建立新目标；直接给类比即可。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": true, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "resolved_input": null, "replies": ["把 Agent harness 想成**医院的手术室团队**。\n\n模型是主刀医生：判断力最强，负责“下一步该怎么切”。但医生不会自己去消毒器械、调监护仪、递钳子、记录用药、在出血时喊停。这些是 harness 干的：术前把该看的片子和病历摆上台（装配上下文）、按需递上器械（调用工具）、全程记录并保留可恢复的中间状态（状态持久化）、设定哪些操作必须先请示（权限与审批）、术后核对纱布数量（校验结果），出问题时决定重来还是叫上级（重试、回滚、升级）。\n\n关键类比点是**医生再厉害，也得有手术室才能真的动刀**：模型只会输出一句“我要读 README 然后跑测试”，真正读文件、跑命令、把报错送回去的，是模型之外的那一层。\n\n这个类比只覆盖“模型之外需要一整套支撑系统”这一点，不覆盖 harness 的具体分层和接口设计——那些不同团队的实现差异比较大。\n\n### 参考资料\n\n- [Agent harness](https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agent_harness)\n- [Agent Engineering 101｜01｜Agent Harness](https://llm101.ai/what-is-agent-harness/)\n- [Agent Harness（Agent 脚手架 / 运行时控制层）：核心概念、使用场景与实践说明 | Agent Wiki](https://learnagent.wiki/agent/cards/agent-harness)"], "task_states": [], "nodes": ["received", "understanding", "intent", "model_attempt", "intent", "intent_decided", "teaching_preparation", "model_attempt", "teaching_preparation", "search_not_called", "answer", "model_attempt", "response.started", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "answer", "sources", "response.completed", "completed"], "search_state": "not_called", "provider_events": [], "preparation": [{"official_sources_required": false, "source_domains": [], "concepts": ["Agent harness 的类比解释（脚手架/座舱）"], "public_query": "Agent harness 作用 类比 脚手架 模型与工具之间", "new_knowledge": false}], "sources": [{"url": "https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agent_harness", "chars": 2960}, {"url": "https://llm101.ai/what-is-agent-harness/", "chars": 10000}, {"url": "https://learnagent.wiki/agent/cards/agent-harness", "chars": 7731}]}
