{"input": "我只是问它是什么，不是要你安排学习，先回答我的问题", "status": "completed", "intent": {"clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": true, "repair_target_message_id": "b9139235-daae-427e-8987-8093ff0df5ca", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["question", "correction"], "target_task_id": "c887bdd5-e0c4-43dd-a2d5-5da5c893f71d", "target_description": "解释 harness 是什么、有什么作用", "relation": "continuation", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户指出流程跑偏：只是询问 harness 是什么、有什么作用，不需要先安排学习目标。应纠正为直接回答该概念问题，answer_only=true，不建立训练目标。术语无明确领域上下文，先给通用含义并区分 AI Agent harness 与测试 harness。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "resolved_input": "harness是什么，它有什么作用", "replies": ["抱歉，上一轮我不该先反问你目标，直接回答就好。\n\n**“harness”本身不是一个有唯一定义的术语**，它的含义取决于领域。你问的若没有特别限定，通常有两种常见指向。\n\n## 常见含义\n\n在软件测试里，**test harness（测试夹具/测试装置）** 指围绕被测代码搭起的一整套自动化设施：驱动被测代码、准备输入数据、执行用例、收集结果并输出报告。它让测试可以重复、自动地跑起来，而不必每次手工操作。\n\n在 AI 智能体（agent）语境里，**agent harness** 指模型周围的那层运行基础设施。模型本身是无状态的，只会生成文本；harness 负责驱动多步骤执行、工具调用、状态与记忆的持久化、上下文管理、执行沙箱，以及权限与审批等安全护栏。常见的概括公式是 **Agent = Model + Harness**。\n\n## 作用\n\n两者共通的直觉是：**把某个容易失控的东西“扣”在一个稳定的环境里**。测试里的“失控”是人工操作不可复现，harness 提供确定性的执行与结果判定；agent 语境里的“失控”是模型的非确定性和幻觉，harness 的目标是**可靠性**——让不可靠的模型仍能稳定完成任务。\n\n一个例子：让 agent 去网页上点一个按钮，模型可能其实失败了却报告“已完成”。在 harness 里加一个确定性验证步骤（检查执行轨迹里是否真的发生了点击），它就会如实报告失败；再加一个登录处理器，遇到登录页由 harness 以确定方式处理，弱模型也能完成原本做不到的任务。\n\n需要说明的是：上面 agent harness 的组件清单属于一**参考框架，不是标准定义**，这一领域术语更迭很快，不同团队用法并不统一。另外请注意把“harness 让系统更可靠”理解为**设计目标**，而不是自动获得的保证——效果取决于具体实现。\n\n### 参考资料\n\n- [Agent harness](https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agent_harness)\n- [智能体框架 | Microsoft Learn](https://learn.microsoft.com/zh-cn/agent-framework/concepts/harness)\n- [Harness到底是什么、又为什么重要？跟着IBM工程师的分享深入理解AI Harness · Rosa's Blog](https://www.isrosa.com/posts/harness-what-is-why-important-ai-harness)"], "task_states": [{"status": "cancelled", "stage": "routing_corrected", "required_action": null}], "nodes": ["received", "understanding", "intent", "model_attempt", "intent", "task_updated", "teaching_preparation", "model_attempt", "teaching_preparation", "search_attempt", "web_provider", "web_provider", "public_search", "source_candidates", "model_attempt", "source_candidates", "web_provider", "web_provider", "web_provider", "web_provider", "web_provider", "web_provider", "evidence_assessment", "model_attempt", "evidence_assessment", "search_verified", "answer", "model_attempt", "response.started", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "response.delta", "answer", "sources", "response.completed", "learning_evidence", "completed"], "search_state": "verified", "provider_events": [{"provider": "exa", "operation": "search", "status": "started", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "search", "status": "succeeded", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "started", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "succeeded", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "started", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "succeeded", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "started", "code": ""}, {"provider": "exa", "operation": "read", "status": "succeeded", "code": ""}], "preparation": [{"official_sources_required": false, "source_domains": [], "concepts": ["harness 的通用含义（线束/挽具/安全带）", "测试/验证语境中的 test harness（测试框架：驱动、桩、断言、报告）", "Agent 语境中的 agent harness（智能体循环、工具调用、上下文管理、权限与人工确认）", "harness 在不同语境下的作用与适用范围"], "public_query": "harness 含义 作用 test harness 测试框架 agent harness 智能体 对比 区别", "new_knowledge": true}], "sources": [{"url": "https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agent_harness", "chars": 2960}, {"url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/zh-cn/agent-framework/concepts/harness", "chars": 4861}, {"url": "https://www.isrosa.com/posts/harness-what-is-why-important-ai-harness", "chars": 5835}]}
